
description: The enemy presence in this region is very low, making it a perfect place to start the conquest of Pistonia. Anomalous biological mass appears to be present all over the planets surface, and it may be utilized for advanced industry.

details: This planet appears to be almost living, in a way. This may become very useful for manufacturing, or a complete disaster for our bases.
